{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2021-05-20 10:00:00', 'title': 'GE DIGITAL RECEIVES HIGHEST SCORE FOR CONTINUOUS PROCESS MANUFACTURING USE CASE IN 2021 GARTNER CRITICAL CAPABILITIES FOR MANUFACTURING EXECUTION SYSTEMS REPORT', 'text': "SAN RAMON, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CPG--GE DIGITAL TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT SCORED IN THE TOP FOUR ACROSS THESE CRITICAL CAPABILITIES: IN-PROCESS QUALITY MANAGEMENT, DATA MANAGEMENT/DATA COLLECTION, PRODUCTION EQUIPMENT INTEGRATION, AND ENTERPRISE INTEGRATION ARCHITECTURE IN THE 2021 GARTNER CRITICAL CAPABILITIES FOR MANUFACTURING EXECUTION SYSTEMS REPORT. “WE ARE HONORED TO RECEIVE THIS RECOGNITION FOR OUR MES SOLUTION FROM GARTNER,” SAID RICHARD KENEDI, GENERAL MANAGER OF GE DIGITAL'S MANUFACTURIN"}